flowchart LR
 Begin(( )) --> Choose(Choose data and analysis recipe)
 Choose --> Scope{Interval required?}
 Scope -->|yes| Propose(Propose or select intervals)
 Propose --> Review(Researcher reviews intervals)
 Review --> Evaluate(Calculate result)
 Scope -->|no| Evaluate
 Evaluate --> Quality{Valid result?}
 Quality -->|yes| Save(Save result with input references)
 Quality -->|no| Explain(Show missing inputs or failed checks)
 Save --> Finish((( )))
 Explain --> Finish
